  "ingredients": [
    "2 cups all-purpose flour",
    "1 teaspoon baking powder",
    "0.5 teaspoon baking soda",
    "0.5 teaspoon salt",
    "1 cup white sugar",
    "0.5 cup butter",
    "2 large eggs",
    "1.25 teaspoons vanilla",
    "1.5 cups chopped apples",
    "0.33333334326744 cup packed brown sugar",
    "1 tablespoon all-purpose flour",
    "0.125 teaspoon ground cinnamon",
    "1 tablespoon butter"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Preheat the oven to 375 degrees F (190 degrees C). Grease or line a 12-cup muffin tin with paper liners.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix flour, baking powder, baking soda, and salt in a medium bowl.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/piojwixjdgCjUePtEIZfscb1O0Y=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/33157-apple-strudel-muffins-step-1-0505-1-f16ac2df18ee4bbc92d3d23672ac397c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/33157/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Beat sugar, butter, and eggs together in a large bowl until smooth. Mix in vanilla. Stir in apples, then gradually blend in flour mixture. Spoon batter into the prepared muffin cups, filling each 2/3 full.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/0YRPp1eYmZrJNQBCHuO4CvN0IAY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/33157-apple-strudel-muffins-step-2-0507-1-9bdf72ef418248bd8e528a194c0ef585.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/33157/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Make topping: Mix brown sugar, flour, and cinnamon in a small bowl. Cut in butter until mixture resembles coarse crumbs. Sprinkle over each muffin top.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/8ftnFsxhhxwJfkLx4UhmXSTOzto=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/33157-apple-strudel-muffins-step-3-0508-1-1abf657983e943adbb69de4f95c3be11.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/33157/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until a toothpick inserted in the center of a muffin comes out clean, about 20 minutes. Let sit 5 minutes before transferring muffins to a wire rack to cool.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/3vbWXdxNAT84Bk8oLkSVghS9k-Y=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/33157-apple-strudel-muffins-step-4-0533-1-e4ccf9b9b75f47f9a2bb79a7093d5754.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/33157/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/UOYUPXP40vSsx83JQGN7-L68_k0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/33157-apple-strudel-muffins-DDMFS-4x3-63b8d2bfd4194f4f96173793deaf5e2b.jpg"
